<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS TIME-TRIAL GOLD.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS TIME-TRIAL GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>LUGANO, Switzerland 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's Alex</p>
<p>Zuelle won the men's time trial gold medal at the world road</p>
<p>race championships on Thursday.</p>
<p>Chris Boardman of Britain took the silver and Switzerland's</p>
<p>Tony Rominger the bronze.</p>
</text>
